{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o052a","title":"曹操东征袁术斩其留将","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o052a-account","label":"正文","text":"袁术侵陈，闻曹操亲来而走，曹操击杀桥蕤、李丰、梁纲、乐就，袁术渡淮。","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0057","role":"侵陈退走","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"东征","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0134","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0135","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0136","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0137","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"陈、淮","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二年秋九月","year":197,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o052a-q","wudi-q-o050","wudi-q-b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d"],"chronology":"wudi-y197","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o050","basis":"建安二年秋九月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,301,"O052a"],"order":137}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0135","name":"李丰（袁术将）","evidence":["wudi-q-o052"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o052-wudi-p0135","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o052"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o052a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8ec86cba86065a1316d1","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，术侵陈，公东征之。术闻公自来，弃军走，留其将桥蕤、李丰、梁纲、乐就。公到，击破蕤等，皆斩之。术走，渡淮〖12〗。公还许。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-40d8b7057f4a29d6fe0d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖3〗二年：建安二年（公元 197）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-de6807349faf5c41a470","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o050","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2d0fc350fb933237a70","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖3〗，公到宛〖4〗。张绣降，既而悔之，复反。公与战，军败，为流矢所中。长子昂、弟子安民遇害〖5〗。﹝一﹞公乃引兵还舞阴〖6〗，绣将骑来抄〖7〗。公击破之，绣奔穰〖8〗，与刘表合。公谓诸将曰：“吾降张绣等，失不便取其质〖9〗，以至于此。吾知所以败。诸卿观之：自今以后，不复败矣！”遂还许。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o052","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8ec86cba86065a1316d1","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，术侵陈，公东征之。术闻公自来，弃军走，留其将桥蕤、李丰、梁纲、乐就。公到，击破蕤等，皆斩之。术走，渡淮〖12〗。公还许。公之自舞阴还也，南阳章陵诸县复叛为绣〖13〗。公遣曹洪击之，不利。还屯叶〖14〗，数为绣、表所侵〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
